        "# ML-04 — Search Intelligence Data Contract\n",
        "\n",
        "## 1) Data contract\n",
        "\n",
        "**1. What does one row mean for my lane?**  \n",
        "One row represents one search/query record for a page and time period in the Search Intelligence warehouse. The row contains the information available for that entity at the reporting period.\n",
        "\n",
        "**2. Which table(s) will I use?**  \n",
        "I will use the released Search Intelligence warehouse table available through the FlyRank Hugging Face warehouse and DuckDB workflow provided in the starter repository.\n",
        "\n",
        "**3. What time window will I use?**  \n",
        "I will develop and verify the lane on the mid-panel month `2026-03`, rather than the final `_sample` month, so the outcome window remains separate from development.\n",
        "\n",
        "**4. What will I predict or rank?**  \n",
        "The modeling target will be a future search-performance outcome/label supplied by the warehouse. Features will use only information available at the decision moment.\n",
        "\n",
        "**5. What will I deliberately exclude?**  \n",
        "I will exclude any feature that contains future-period information or is directly derived from the target/label, because it would create data leakage.\n"
      ],
      "id": "DoNMCdxT2-17"
    },
