        "### Why each feature is available when?\n",
        "\n",
        "| Feature | Available when? |\n",
        "|---|---|\n",
        "| `impressions_90d` | Available at the decision moment because it summarizes the preceding 90-day search history. |\n",
        "| `avg_position` | Available at the decision moment because it describes observed ranking performance from the historical window. |\n",
        "| `avg_ctr` | Available at the decision moment because it is calculated from already observed search interactions. |\n",
        "| `clicks_90d` | Available at the decision moment because it summarizes clicks observed before the prediction point. |\n",
        "| `page_type` | Available at the decision moment because the page classification is an existing page attribute, not a future outcome. |\n"
      ],
